 RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION (RAG) PIPELINE ARCHITECTURE


===========================
1. INDEXING PHASE (Offline)
===========================

PDF documents
      |
      v
pdf_loader.py
      |
      ├── load_all_pdfs(folder)
      |       |
      |       └── Reads every PDF inside /documents
      |
      ├── load_pdf(file)
      |       |
      |       └── Extracts text from every PDF page
      |
      └── split_text(text)
              |
              └── Splits the extracted text into chunks


      |
      v

embeddings.py
      |
      ├── SentenceTransformer("all-MiniLM-L6-v2")
      |
      └── create_embeddings(chunks)
              |
              └── Converts every text chunk into an embedding vector


      |
      v

vector_store.py
      |
      ├── create_vector_store(embeddings, chunks)
      |       |
      |       ├── Creates a FAISS index
      |       ├── Stores embedding vectors
      |       └── Associates every vector with its original text chunk
      |
      └── save_vector_store()
              |
              ├── Saves faiss.index
              └── Saves metadata.pkl


==================================================================

==========================
2. QUERY PHASE (Online)
==========================

User enters a question
        |
        v

rag_pipeline.py
        |
        └── retrieve_information(question)
                |
                ├── create_embeddings([question])[0]
                |       |
                |       ├── File:
                |       |     embeddings.py
                |       |
                |       └── Converts the user question into
                |           an embedding vector
                |
                ├── load_vector_store()
                |       |
                |       ├── File:
                |       |     vector_store.py
                |       |
                |       └── Loads:
                |             • faiss.index
                |             • metadata.pkl
                |
                └── search_vector_store(index,
                                        metadata,
                                        embedding,
                                        k=3)
                        |
                        ├── File:
                        |     vector_store.py
                        |
                        ├── Performs similarity search in FAISS
                        |
                        └── Retrieves the 3 most relevant
                            document chunks


        |
        v

context = "\n\n".join(relevant_chunks)
        |
        └── File:
              rag_pipeline.py
        |
        └── Combines the retrieved chunks into a single context


        |
        v

generate_answer(question, context)
        |
        ├── File:
        |     rag_pipeline.py
        |
        ├── Builds the prompt
        |
        ├── Adds:
        |      • User question
        |      • Retrieved context
        |
        └── ChatOllama(model="qwen2.5:0.5b")
                |
                └── Generates the final answer


        |
        v

Final answer returned to the user






